<title>USA: King Cty, Wash., repriced at a 5.58 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>King Cty, Wash., repriced at a 5.58 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Friday it repriced King County, Wash., $78 million lease revenue bonds, cutting the yields in the 2017 and 2026 maturities two basis points.</p>
<p>CDP-King County III</p>
<p>RE: $78,275,000*</p>
<p>Lease Revenue Bonds, 1997</p>
<p>(King Street Center Project)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>All orders previously entered will be considered good unless</p>
<p>we hear to the contrary by 12:45PM Today.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 06/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
